    "english": {
      "headingRaw": "Seven-character-regular-verseLiShangyinTOONEUNNAMEDII",
      "translationRaw": "Amistyraincomesblowingwithawindfromtheeast，AndwheelsfaintlythunderbeyondHibiscusPool。。。。Roundthegolden-toadlock，incenseiscreeping；Thejadetigertells，onitscord，ofwaterbeingdrawnAgreatladyonce，frombehindascreen，favouredapooryouth；Afairyqueenbroughtabridalmatoncefortheeaseofaprinceandthenvanished。。。。Musthumanheartsblossominspring，likeallotherflowers？Andofeventhisbrightflameoflove，shalltherebeonlyashes？",
